regarding a couple of questions about wands of cancellation, they
are also good for zapping at water demons.  a reasonable character
(circa level 13 barbarian eg) can take out a water demon, and quaffing
at all those fountains sometimes gives wishes.  the only problem is
when the water demon gates in jubilex or somesuch ... ouch
(if jubilex engulfs you - you not only take awesome damage you get
'sick' as well.)
if you cancel the water demon he loses this ability :-)

also good for making lots of water/blank scrolls if you don't
have levitation/waterwalking/lots of fountains

